---
import CarpeItDoc from '../../../layouts/CarpeItDoc.astro';
---

<CarpeItDoc
  title="CarpeIt — Payout setup link expired"
  description="Stripe's payout setup link expired. Start it again from CarpeIt."
  heading="That setup link expired"
>
  <p class="doc-lead">
    Stripe's payout links last only a few minutes, and this one has run out.
    Nothing is lost: start it again from the app and carry on where you left
    off.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a href="carpeit://connect/refresh" class="app-button" id="open-app">Open CarpeIt</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Starting again</h2>
  <p>
    In CarpeIt, go to <strong>Profile → Payments &amp; payouts</strong> and tap
    <strong>Continue payout setup</strong>. Stripe keeps whatever you already
    entered, so you'll only be asked for what's still missing.
  </p>

  <p class="doc-note">
    Stuck? Email
    <a href="mailto:hey@davidferreira.dev?subject=CarpeIt%20payouts">hey@davidferreira.dev</a>.
  </p>
</CarpeItDoc>

<script>
  window.setTimeout(() => { window.location.href = 'carpeit://connect/refresh'; }, 400);
</script>

<style>
.app-button {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #07171E !important;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
  border-radius: 100px;
  text-decoration: none !important;
  transition: background 0.15s;
}
.app-button:hover { background: #e2fb8c; }
</style>
